{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a house from the ground up by placing and adjusting walls, selecting facade materials and adding windows and doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape the perfect roof, modify the ceilings, decorate the garden, place furniture, make a balcony or a porch. It's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ModernDuskSeq.01492024.12.1815.15.20resized.png?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The building system uses optional grid and snapping functionality to give you freedom in designing, while still allowing you to perfectly line up objects when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a library of 3000+ objects and materials to craft a space that reflects your unique tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ChairsGifV5.gif?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Express your style by tailoring every aspect to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/Baseboardgif5.gif?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter First Person Mode and take a tour of your dream house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/FPSGIFV5_616.gif?t=1743017448\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take pictures of your house in Photo Mode and share your best creations with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/PhotoModeSeq.01492024.12.0721.45.23.png?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dream Home Designer  fully utilizes dynamic ray traced lighting, high resolution textures and detailed models for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3014340?t=1743017448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3014340?t=1743017448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/5005871cc3a7446463d07f1a515bbc617effa513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743017448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/5005871cc3a7446463d07f1a515bbc617effa513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743017448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a house from the ground up by placing and adjusting walls, selecting facade materials and adding windows and doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape the perfect roof, modify the ceilings, decorate the garden, place furniture, make a balcony or a porch. It's all up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ModernDuskSeq.01492024.12.1815.15.20resized.png?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The building system uses optional grid and snapping functionality to give you freedom in designing, while still allowing you to perfectly line up objects when needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a library of 3000+ objects and materials to craft a space that reflects your unique tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/ChairsGifV5.gif?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Express your style by tailoring every aspect to your preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/Baseboardgif5.gif?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter First Person Mode and take a tour of your dream house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/FPSGIFV5_616.gif?t=1743017448\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take pictures of your house in Photo Mode and share your best creations with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/extras/PhotoModeSeq.01492024.12.0721.45.23.png?t=1743017448\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dream Home Designer  fully utilizes dynamic ray traced lighting, high resolution textures and detailed models for an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Hazel Interval"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014340/header.jpg?t=1743017448","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></